 \tag{7.57}
\end{equation}$$ for $(v,\beta)\in\mathcal D_{S(\alpha)}^\Gamma\times\mathbb R^n$. Such a pair solves (7.12) at $\alpha$ exactly when it solves (7.57) with $g=(v\cdot\nabla)v$.

